<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
<title>Platform Settings — Super Admin</title>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Plus+Jakarta+Sans:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
*{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0;padding:0}
body{font-family:'Plus Jakarta Sans',sans-serif;background:#f3f4f6;color:#111}
.top{background:#1a1a2e;color:#fff;padding:16px 24px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between}
.top h1{font-size:18px;font-weight:700}
.top a{color:#a5b4fc;text-decoration:none;font-size:13px;margin-left:16px}
.main{padding:24px;max-width:600px;margin:0 auto}
.page-header{margin-bottom:20px}
.page-header h2{font-size:20px;font-weight:700}
.card{background:#fff;border-radius:12px;border:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding:24px;margin-bottom:20px}
.card h3{font-size:15px;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:4px}
.card p{font-size:12px;color:#6b7280;margin-bottom:20px}
.form-group{margin-bottom:16px}
label{display:block;font-size:12px;font-weight:600;color:#374151;margin-bottom:4px}
input{width:100%;padding:9px 12px;border:1px solid #d1d5db;border-radius:8px;font-family:inherit;font-size:13px;outline:none;font-family:monospace}
input:focus{border-color:#6366f1;box-shadow:0 0 0 3px rgba(99,102,241,.1)}
.btn{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;padding:10px 20px;border-radius:8px;border:none;font-family:inherit;font-size:13px;font-weight:600;cursor:pointer}
.btn-indigo{background:#6366f1;color:#fff}
.alert{padding:10px 14px;border-radius:8px;font-size:13px;margin-bottom:16px}
.alert-success{background:#d1fae5;color:#065f46}
.tip{background:#eff6ff;border:1px solid #bfdbfe;border-radius:8px;padding:12px 14px;font-size:12px;color:#1e40af;margin-bottom:20px}
.tip strong{display:block;margin-bottom:4px}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="top">
  <h1>👑 Super Admin</h1>
  <div>
    <a href="/superadmin">Dashboard</a>
    <a href="/superadmin/vendors">Vendors</a>
    <a href="/superadmin/plans">Plans</a>
    <a href="/superadmin/logout">Logout</a>
  </div>
</div>
<div class="main">
  <div class="page-header"><h2>⚙️ Platform Settings</h2></div>

  <% if(locals.query && locals.query.saved){ %>
  <div class="alert alert-success">✅ Settings saved successfully!</div>
  <% } %>

  <div class="tip">
    <strong>💡 Razorpay Setup</strong>
    Yeh keys platform ke liye hain — jab bhi koi restaurant subscription kharidega, payment tumhare Razorpay account mein ayegi.
    Keys: <a href="https://dashboard.razorpay.com/app/keys" target="_blank" style="color:#1e40af">dashboard.razorpay.com → Settings → API Keys</a>
  </div>

  <div class="card">
    <h3>💳 Razorpay Payment Gateway</h3>
    <p>Subscription payments ke liye platform Razorpay keys set karo. Ek baar save karo — sab vendors ke liye kaam karega.</p>
    <form method="POST" action="/superadmin/settings">
      <div class="form-group">
        <label>Razorpay Key ID</label>
        <input type="text" name="platform_razorpay_key_id" value="<%= rzpKeyId %>" placeholder="rzp_live_xxxxxxxxxxxx">
      </div>
      <div class="form-group">
        <label>Razorpay Key Secret</label>
        <input type="password" name="platform_razorpay_key_secret" value="<%= rzpKeySecret %>" placeholder="••••••••••••••••••••••••">
        <div style="font-size:11px;color:#6b7280;margin-top:4px">Secret encrypted nahi hai — server pe secure rakho</div>
      </div>
      <button type="submit" class="btn btn-indigo">💾 Save Settings</button>
    </form>
  </div>

  <div class="card" style="background:#f9fafb">
    <h3 style="color:#374151">Status</h3>
    <div style="margin-top:12px;font-size:13px">
      <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;margin-bottom:8px">
        <span style="width:10px;height:10px;border-radius:50%;background:<%= rzpKeyId ? '#1db954' : '#e53935' %>;display:inline-block"></span>
        Razorpay Key ID: <strong><%= rzpKeyId ? rzpKeyId.substring(0,12)+'...' : 'Not set' %></strong>
      </div>
      <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px">
        <span style="width:10px;height:10px;border-radius:50%;background:<%= rzpKeySecret ? '#1db954' : '#e53935' %>;display:inline-block"></span>
        Razorpay Secret: <strong><%= rzpKeySecret ? '••••••••••••' : 'Not set' %></strong>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
</body>
</html>
